  "conclusion": "Queue wait, dispatch wait, and worker duration explain 97.36% of response wait. The configured two-millisecond collection window consumed 5.02 milliseconds per batch on average under the single-core workload, while batches averaged only 5.74 rows. This supports a bounded backlog-aware dispatch experiment; it does not support changing database or durability semantics.",
